      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi! Are you ready for Saturday? I've already bought snacks for the beach!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Hi, Omar. Actually, I've just heard the weather forecast. It says there'll be strong wind and rain on Saturday."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Oh no, really? So the beach isn't a good idea."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "No, not on Saturday. Sunday will be sunny, but you work until three, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes. If we leave at three thirty, we'll get there at five. It gets dark at six."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That's too short. What do you think about going next Saturday instead? The forecast says it'll be sunny."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good idea. But what do we do this Saturday? I don't want to stay at home all day."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "How about the new science museum at ten in the morning, and then lunch at the fish restaurant near the river? It's indoors, so the rain won't matter."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hmm, museums aren't really my thing. What about a movie?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "I'd prefer the museum. It has interactive rooms, so it isn't boring. But we could see a movie in the evening too."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Okay, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Great. So this Saturday, the museum at ten, then lunch, and a movie in the evening. And the beach next Saturday."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Perfect. I'll keep the snacks for next week!"
    }
  ],
